++  <li><strong>Research data and reports</strong> — pull tables into Excel for further analysis</li>
++  <li><strong>Government data PDFs</strong> — census tables, budget documents, statistical releases</li>
++</ul>
++
++<h2>Why convert without uploading?</h2>
++<p>Financial documents contain sensitive data — account numbers, transaction history, personal details. Tools that upload your PDF to a server expose that data unnecessarily. RightPDFKit converts entirely in your browser using client-side JavaScript. Nothing is ever sent to a server.</p>
